AuthorDate: Sat Jun 15 10:14:44 2024 +0000
Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Sat Jun 15 10:14:44 2024 +0000

    Bug 1902610 - Replace reStructuredText double backtick notation for inline literals with <var>. r=mkmelin

    Our schema files use notations which were originally intended to be
    interpreted by our documentation generator only. However, other
    projects started to parse them as well and this patch moves towards a
    notation used by Firefox, to increase interoperability of such projects.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D213747

